    "intro_narrative": "You have infiltrated the underground server facility of the elusive shadow syndicate known as 'Blacksite'. The air is frigid, filled with the deafening hum of liquid-cooled mainframes and illuminated only by the harsh, pulsating blue light of server racks. Your objective is critical: retrieve the syndicate's encrypted ledger before their automated scrubbers delete everything. The ledger is protected by a labyrinth of both physical biometric vaults and complex digital cryptographic layers. With the facility's security lockdown already initiated, you have exactly twenty minutes until a total sector purge. You must trace network routes, decrypt archives, and bypass physical lockboxes to extract the master data core. Every second counts, and the system is designed to trap intruders in an endless loop of encryption.",
    "narrative_style": "techno_thriller"
  },
